{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n張智霖（Chilam）在TVB節目《璀璨之城》中飾演的「孝賢」奸險狡猾，與江美儀的連場鬥法看得觀眾肉緊。不過，鏡頭後原來發生爆笑一幕，Chilam竟被江美儀的強大氣場震懾到當場NG，更出現與劇中形象180度轉變的「反差萌」表情，場面相當搞笑！\n</p>\n<h2>NG花絮大公開 張智霖被江美儀氣場震懾</h2>\n<p>在拍攝一場張智霖與江美儀互睥的對峙戲時，鏡頭後的Chilam似乎被對手的凌厲氣勢完全壓倒。據幕後花絮透露，Chilam被美儀姐一輪凌厲的眼神攻擊後，竟然瞬間進入「忘我狀態」，完全忘記要接下一句對白，導致NG。當時同場的高海寧及江美儀更要開聲提醒他，才把他從呆滯中喚醒。</p>\n<h2>張智霖一臉懵懂扁嘴自責 與劇中奸險樣成強烈反差</h2>\n<p>被提醒後回過神的張智霖，一臉懵懂的表情與劇中精明奸險的孝賢形成強烈對比。他更忍不住扁起嘴自責，可愛的反應與劇中角色的狠勁完全不同，展現出驚人的「反差萌」，讓現場工作人員忍俊不禁。這個意想不到的Cutie時刻，揭示了Chilam在鏡頭背後輕鬆有趣的一面。</p>\n<h2>網民笑爆：原來Chilam都有今日！</h2>\n<p>這段有趣的NG花絮曝光後，隨即引來網民熱烈討論，紛紛表示被Chilam的可愛反應逗笑。網民留言：「笑死！劇入面奸到出汁，原來鏡頭後會嚇到呆咗！」、「個扁嘴樣太可愛了吧！反差萌我鍾意！」、「江美儀氣場真係強大到可以嚇窒大仙！」、「求更多花絮！想睇多啲咁得意嘅Chilam！」、「呢個NG片段可以loop一百次，太好笑了！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/45_17792958366ae17c3125db6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/45_17792958366ae17c3125db6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/46_1384759266ae17c3405225.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/46_1384759266ae17c3405225.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/47_20898501996ae17c3721d46.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/47_20898501996ae17c3721d46.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/48_5062615026ae17c3a166bb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/48_5062615026ae17c3a166bb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/49_11145769866ae17c3cc112a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/49_11145769866ae17c3cc112a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:55.991756+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":876,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:00:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:44.063117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:35.824051+00:00","content_hash":"3495a98fab008931883136da97cefa2710d62d34ef49306edf87d641b9061035","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}